      promptHtml: `<p style="margin:0 0 12px 0">During Year 1, Scott Corp. purchased marketable equity securities. Pertinent data follow:</p><table class="mx-table" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse; margin-top:15px; width:100%"><thead><tr><th class="mx-txt" style="border-bottom:2px solid #01506e; padding:10px">Security</th><th class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:2px solid #01506e; padding:10px">Cost</th><th class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:2px solid #01506e; padding:10px">Market Value at 12/31/Year 1</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="mx-txt" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">D</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$36,000</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$40,000</td></tr><tr><td class="mx-txt" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">E</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$80,000</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$60,000</td></tr><tr><td class="mx-txt" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">F</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$180,000</td><td class="mx-num" style="border-bottom:1px solid #dddddd; padding:10px">$186,000</td></tr></tbody></table><div style="background-color:white; border:1px solid #dddddd; border-radius:5px; color:#12232d; font-family:monospace; margin:0 0 12px 0; padding:12px; text-align:center"><strong>Total cost = $296,000; Total market value = $286,000. Scott appropriately carries these securities at market value. The amount of unrealized loss on these securities in Scott&#x27;s Year 1 income statement should be:</strong></div>`,
